{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01W7", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-H-projective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8899660dda803a1d631a112f0053400c2b3301f032e70c38a7445440875da1a5", "source_text": "An H-projective morphism is H-quasi-projective.\nAn H-projective morphism is projective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:895a12c4deca725d9afc3bb036694e86cebb0e5b15a2402ff032dcb388f0f034", "unit_id": "tag:01W9:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01W7", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathbf{P}^n_S$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{constructions-lemma-projective-space-bundle}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3afe6ac363ca693ffdfeffd2bbe40ac693c8c9143c5fd76089564a13085302d1", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a0b3560ca7bde8b92a20eaa2a74c873e1072f10209df8a9f7b488e8687a06155", "source_text": "The first statement is immediate from the definitions.\nThe second holds as <MATH_0001> is a projective bundle over <MATH_0002>, see\nConstructions, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b06c72d83043f6577349a6baeaefb29db907bf5334e7802e05ba37d955232419", "unit_id": "tag:01W9:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01W7", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$S = \\bigcup U_i$", "MATH_0004": "$f^{-1}(U_i) \\to U_i$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-characterize-locally-projective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:fcb6ac5ba1df0a659066489f54a9b005f7a250d74da39fee28932ec0971d0ab4", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9f069b389495e4e793a6315a477b565d46d0a55da595e4e3b528e4ffe6ae440a", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nThe following are equivalent:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> The morphism <MATH_0002> is locally projective.\n<STRUCT_0003> There exists an open covering <MATH_0003> such\nthat each <MATH_0004> is H-projective.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8e4f887cb7c8897631fdb4afa94309dbf8d38e10c87610495fb731b4cd48664d", "unit_id": "tag:01WB:statement"}
